OL,3,AKenya confirms its first Ebola death as
OL,4,Aoutbreak spreads
OL,5,
OL,6,FDuale said the patient boarded a flight
OL,7,Fon Saturday and underwent normal public
OL,8,Fscreening at the main airport in
OL,9,FNairobi before he was transferred by a
OL,10,Frelative to a hospital in the city.
OL,11,FTests conducted confirmed positive for
OL,12,FEbola Bundibugyo virus.
OL,14,FMore than 4,000 people have died from
OL,15,FEbola in DR Congo this year, in what is
OL,16,Fthe second most deadly known outbreak
OL,17,Fof the disease.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
